{
  "about": "The places you can stamp from. Each entry is { name, country, lat, lon, packId, aliases }. Your phone's position is matched to the nearest city within 60 km (the coordinates are only used for that and are never saved: only the city's name goes on the postcard); if none is near you pick one from the list, or type a place that is not here. aliases are other names people search by (Calcutta, Bombay, Bangalore). packId is the city sticker pack to show in the tray for this city. It is null for every city today because no city packs have been drawn yet: set it to a pack id from sticker-packs.json once one exists (a Kolkata pack of taxis, trams and Howrah Bridge is the first planned). Keep the list to about 150; the tests check names are unique and positions are real.",
